Infinity Core Contributors adapted the chunkwise triangular transform and state
scan to native packed CUDA inference in kernels/qwen35_chunk.cu. The adaptation
uses exact-length chunk tails, FP32 state, and immutable per-sequence initial
states. Products of decays replace cumulative-log subtraction so a zero decay
does not produce an infinity-minus-infinity NaN. No Python, Triton, or FLA
runtime is linked by the native implementation. Retained Apache permissions
and notices remain intact.
